{
  "summary": "This experiment tested adding image data via concat fusion to the RNA-only baseline (scvi_n200 RNA encoder and transformer aggregation), achieving validation accuracy of 0.7207 (F1: 0.6815), suggesting multimodal integration improves performance. The result indicates potential benefits of incorporating image data, though the exact contribution of fusion method or image encoder variations remains untested. Uncertainty persists about the relative impact of specific design choices and whether further multimodal configurations could yield additional gains."
}

